B.bd8=new A.nD("Hardy clans","Your levies fight 35% harder, and hills and forests never slow your attacks.")
B.bd9=new A.nD("The great levy","Every Mercian province musters 30% more levies.")
B.bda=new A.nD("Sea kings","Longships cost a third less than other realms' ships and are built on any coast you hold, where your hosts also recruit.")
B.bdb=new A.nD("Mountain fastness","Your hosts and levies fight 30% harder defending Welsh land.")
B.bdc=new A.nD("Northern fury","Your hosts fight 15% harder when they attack.")
B.bdd=new A.nD("Danegeld","Demand gold from a realm you are at war with \u2014 if it fears you, it pays for peace. Your hosts live off the land, and ships carry them to any coast within reach.")
