B.bf0=new A.B("End Turn"," when your orders are given. Your attacks are fought first; then the other realms move (the map replays their moves), and you defend against their attacks.")
B.bf1=new A.B("Colonize"," a province whose people are of another culture or religion: your settlers make them your own in 5 turns, for gold (more for a crowded province).")
B.bf2=new A.B(B.ae,B.b1)
B.bf3=new A.B("Recruit"," in a province of yours with a Barracks. Soldiers cost gold and manpower, and each people fields its own kinds of troops.")
